Windows AArch64 uses the same C calling convention as x86_64 Windows, so
ccall applies; without this, Environment.hs stops with "Unknown mingw32 arch".
Fixed upstream from Cabal 3.16; hadolint 2.15.1 needs Cabal >= 3.12.1 && < 3.13.

--- a/src/Distribution/Compat/Environment.hs	2026-10-04 16:11:41.578273391 -0700
+++ b/src/Distribution/Compat/Environment.hs	2026-10-04 16:11:41.587725200 -0700
@@ -63,7 +63,7 @@
 {- FOURMOLU_DISABLE -}
 # if defined(i386_HOST_ARCH)
 #  define WINDOWS_CCONV stdcall
-# elif defined(x86_64_HOST_ARCH)
+# elif defined(x86_64_HOST_ARCH) || defined(aarch64_HOST_ARCH)
 #  define WINDOWS_CCONV ccall
 # else
 #  error Unknown mingw32 arch
